@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description
[*] --> AVAILABLE
AVAILABLE --> HELD : claim (conditional UPDATE)
HELD --> AVAILABLE : expires_at passed\n(lazy check or sweeper)\nor user cancels
HELD --> PAYMENT_PENDING : checkout submitted\n(deadline extended)
PAYMENT_PENDING --> SOLD : authorize approved
PAYMENT_PENDING --> AVAILABLE : definite decline\nor auth voided
SOLD --> AVAILABLE : refund / release\n(ops only)
SOLD --> [*]
@enduml
